 "title": "EDX/IRB Property Tax Incentive Program • Kiowa County, KS",
 "text": "EDX/IRB Property Tax Incentive Program • Kiowa County, KS\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nResidents\nServices\nCommunity\nSearch\nHome\nNews Flash\nEDX/IRB Property Tax Incentive Program\nNews Flash\nEDX/IRB Property Tax Incentive Program\nHome\nPosted on August 17, 2026\nKiowa County has adopted a Property Tax Incentive Policy to encourage economic development by granting property tax exemptions to businesses that qualify for Economic Development Exemptions (EDX) and/or Industrial Revenue Bonds (IRB). For more information on the incentive program please refer to the official policy and application documents below. Any additional questions regarding the program should be directed to Kiowa County Administration.\nEDX/IRB Property Tax Incentive Program\nRelated News\nWebsite Personalization Now Available!\nHome\nPosted on May 08, 2023\nKeep in Touch\nHome\nPosted on May 08, 2023\nStay connected!\nHome\nPosted on May 08, 2023\nCreate an Account\nHome\nPosted on May 08, 2023\nAgendas\n& Minutes\nFAQs\nReport a\nConcern\nNotify Me®\nEmployment\n-->\nContact Us\nKiowa County Kansas\n211 E Florida Avenue\nGreensburg Kansas, 67054\n620-723-3366\nQuick Links\nEDX/IRB Property Tax Incentive Program\nNeighborhood Revitalization Tax Rebate Program\nCounty Resolutions\nCounty Budgets\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×",
